  "historyNote": "#1972, eff 2-28-82; ss by #2475, eff 9-13-83; ss by #3061, eff 7-18-85, EXPIRED: 7-18-91 New. #5365, eff 3-27-92; amd by #5586, eff 2-22-93; ss by #6904, eff 12-4-98, EXPIRED: 12-4-06 New. #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07 New. #9051, eff 12-27-07; ss by #9200, eff 7-4-08; ss by #10746, eff 1-1-15; ss by #14322, eff 9-15-25, EXPIRES: 9-15-35",
